Modifications by Token360 (2026-10-11):
- README.md: Token360 header image, credit block (author credit, WeChat Official
  Account and QR moved into it), Token360 quick start, "Made with Token360" gallery,
  "Differences from upstream" section. The author's community image link returned
  404 when checked and is kept as an HTML comment.
- README.md / README.en.md: fixed the GPT-Image-2.5 shields.io badge URL (it rendered
  "404 badge not found" upstream).
- README.en.md: new English README (translation of README.md plus the sections above).
- assets/banner.png: removed (upstream generated banner).
  assets/token360-header.webp: new header. Illustration generated with Token360
  (gpt-image-2.5-flare); Token360 wordmark and title overlaid with HTML/headless Chrome.
- examples/token360-gallery/: new sample outputs generated with Token360 models
  (gpt-image-2.5-flare, gpt-image-2.5-sunburst, dola-seedream-5.0-lite, seedream-4.5),
  with prompt files and per-image cost.
- scripts/imagegen.sh (generic fixes; other providers unaffected):
  * IMAGE_API_BASE may end in /v1 (it is stripped; request paths already include /v1).
  * "n" is only sent when --count > 1 (some models reject the parameter).
  * New IMAGE_REF_FIELD (reference-image field name; default image_urls).
  * New IMAGE_EXTRA_BODY (JSON object merged into the request body).
  * Fixed reference-image encoding on Linux: GNU base64 wraps lines, which produced
    invalid JSON; newlines are now stripped.
- SKILL.md, references/model-routing.md: short Token360 configuration notes.
- .env.example: new.

